WEBVTT

00:13.313 --> 00:14.678
I-It can't be...

00:20.954 --> 00:21.921
Missie...

00:23.289 --> 00:24.415
Arashi...

00:29.195 --> 00:31.720
He was the one that protected me!

00:31.798 --> 00:33.356
Why did you do this?

00:34.467 --> 00:35.900
Why, missie?

00:37.470 --> 00:40.564
Arashi Kishu of the Dragons of Heaven is gone.

00:41.708 --> 00:43.642
I am a Dragon of Earth.

00:45.011 --> 00:45.978
Hold on!

00:47.180 --> 00:50.149
T-This is too cruel, Arashi...

01:00.627 --> 01:01.594
Why?

01:08.635 --> 01:12.435
I was worried 'cause you disappeared without a word!

01:12.505 --> 01:14.973
I don't know what in the world happened!

01:15.041 --> 01:16.133
What's this about?

01:16.209 --> 01:17.676
Tell me your reasons!

01:18.745 --> 01:19.712
Wait!

01:25.251 --> 01:27.116
M-Missie...

01:29.155 --> 01:30.816
I thought I told you.

01:30.890 --> 01:32.448
I'm a Dragon of Earth.

01:36.196 --> 01:38.061
Are you serious?

01:44.671 --> 01:45.695
Missie...

02:14.134 --> 02:18.036
Episode 23
Earth

02:25.645 --> 02:29.706
I'm sorry to hear about the princess...

02:29.782 --> 02:30.749
Yeah...

02:34.587 --> 02:36.817
I heard... about Arashi.

02:37.857 --> 02:38.824
I see.

02:40.226 --> 02:42.922
I can't really come to believe it...

02:42.996 --> 02:45.487
That Arashi would betray us...

02:45.565 --> 02:47.590
I'm sure she has a reason for it.

02:48.635 --> 02:50.125
No.

02:50.203 --> 02:51.898
No matter what the reason...

02:51.971 --> 02:55.702
Now that she betrayed us to be a Dragon of Earth, she's our enemy.

02:55.775 --> 02:56.901
Sorata...

02:58.144 --> 02:59.406
Kamui.

02:59.479 --> 03:02.004
Now that the Divine Sword's seal is broken...

03:02.081 --> 03:05.482
...settling this fight is just a matter of time.

03:05.552 --> 03:09.318
Both Yuzuriha and Mr. Aoki can't use their powers now...

03:09.389 --> 03:11.357
...and Subaru isn't here.

03:11.424 --> 03:13.187
But don't worry.

03:13.259 --> 03:14.692
I'm here.

03:14.761 --> 03:17.628
I won't let the Dragons of Earth have their way.

03:17.697 --> 03:19.096
Right?

03:19.165 --> 03:20.132
Yeah...

03:36.249 --> 03:37.841
Yuzuriha.

03:37.917 --> 03:40.351
You haven't slept at all since last night, right?

03:40.420 --> 03:42.980
You need to rest at least a little...

03:43.056 --> 03:47.288
But Kusanagi got hurt this badly because of me...

03:48.861 --> 03:51.659
Inuki has been like this since last night, too...

03:52.699 --> 03:54.030
It's all right.

03:54.100 --> 03:58.298
I'm sure Inuki will turn back to his usual self when you get better.

04:12.619 --> 04:14.553
Am I interrupting?

04:15.888 --> 04:17.287
Mr. Aoki!

04:17.357 --> 04:19.655
You need to stay in bed!

04:19.726 --> 04:23.594
Well, there was something that I wanted to tell you...

04:25.798 --> 04:27.959
When Arashi disappeared...

04:28.034 --> 04:30.332
...we had no idea why she was gone.

04:31.371 --> 04:33.032
Everyone was just shocked.

04:34.207 --> 04:36.937
But Karen seemed to have felt something...

04:37.010 --> 04:38.568
...and she told me...

04:39.612 --> 04:43.104
...that this was perhaps a way for her to show her love.

04:44.150 --> 04:47.608
You and Arashi were attracted to each other...

04:48.655 --> 04:51.317
...and she acted this way because of that.

04:54.694 --> 04:55.820
In other words...

04:55.895 --> 04:58.159
...Arashi did this to protect you.

04:58.231 --> 04:59.960
To protect me?

05:00.033 --> 05:04.060
H-How does betraying the Dragons of Heaven protect me?

05:05.838 --> 05:11.401
A woman's feelings are complex and intangible to men...

05:12.679 --> 05:13.976
But...

05:14.047 --> 05:18.108
...we Dragons of Heaven each have our own special powers.

05:18.184 --> 05:21.779
And those powers are there to protect our loved ones.

05:23.022 --> 05:25.081
That's one thing I'm sure of.

05:31.331 --> 05:33.196
Now that the seal is broken...

05:33.266 --> 05:35.860
...the Divine Sword is yours to wield.

05:35.935 --> 05:38.665
It means that the Promised Day has come.

05:38.738 --> 05:41.036
When you take hold of the Divine Sword...

05:41.107 --> 05:43.041
...it will call the other one...

05:43.109 --> 05:45.543
...and unite the Kamuis of Heaven and Earth.

05:45.611 --> 05:48.512
And the fate of the Earth will be determined.

05:48.581 --> 05:51.448
Hinoto told me I haven't awakened yet...

05:51.517 --> 05:55.317
...as the true Kamui of the Dragons of Heaven.

05:55.388 --> 05:58.516
But still, I need to wield the Divine Sword.

05:58.591 --> 06:01.754
Princess Hinoto entrusted you with everything.

06:02.729 --> 06:06.130
Believing that you will become the true Kamui.

06:07.433 --> 06:09.731
And I believe so, as well.

06:30.623 --> 06:31.590
I feel it.

06:32.658 --> 06:35.218
The presence of the other Divine Sword...

06:36.396 --> 06:37.522
Fuma...

06:46.672 --> 06:50.403
The Dragon of Heaven Kamui has wielded the Divine Sword.

06:50.476 --> 06:52.569
Just as in the dreams.

06:52.645 --> 06:56.103
And one of our vacant spots has been filled.

06:56.182 --> 06:57.706
Just as you wished.

07:00.052 --> 07:02.714
Everything is for the man you love.

07:02.789 --> 07:06.486
For the man who is fated to die protecting you.

07:07.727 --> 07:10.127
To change destiny and save his soul...

07:10.196 --> 07:13.393
...you need to kill the Kamui of the Dragons of Heaven.

07:13.466 --> 07:15.093
Correct?

07:15.168 --> 07:17.500
I wouldn't be here if there was another way.

07:31.250 --> 07:34.947
When I first met you, you said that you "decided" on me.

07:35.988 --> 07:37.319
Yeah, I said that.

07:38.357 --> 07:40.825
I've decided on you, missie.

07:40.893 --> 07:43.293
What did you decide?

07:44.697 --> 07:47.325
The one who I will sacrifice my life for.

07:53.372 --> 07:55.306
What about my feelings?

07:59.178 --> 08:01.544
You ignore my feelings...

08:01.614 --> 08:03.172
And get hurt like this...

08:03.249 --> 08:05.342
How I feel about you...

08:06.552 --> 08:08.179
I know...

08:08.254 --> 08:10.950
You don't feel anything for me...

08:12.225 --> 08:14.693
I did this on my own 'cause I wanted to.

08:14.760 --> 08:16.387
It has nothing to do with you.

08:16.462 --> 08:17.724
It does!

08:19.966 --> 08:25.563
Do you think I would be all right if you got hurt or even died?

08:27.306 --> 08:29.604
Can it be that the missie...

08:30.977 --> 08:32.569
...did this to protect me?

08:38.484 --> 08:39.473
Kamui!

08:57.336 --> 08:58.564
Subaru...

09:02.542 --> 09:05.033
I came to say goodbye.

09:05.111 --> 09:07.841
I'm going to settle things with Fuma.

09:07.914 --> 09:10.382
I don't know what will happen in the end...

09:11.417 --> 09:15.080
Subaru, you told me when you lost your right eye...

09:16.022 --> 09:19.480
...that it was what you wished upon yourself.

09:19.559 --> 09:22.892
That to make the future you wished for a reality...

09:22.962 --> 09:25.590
...would make the ones you love very sad.

09:28.100 --> 09:29.897
Subaru...

09:29.969 --> 09:31.903
Did your wish come true?

09:36.208 --> 09:38.199
I want to bring Fuma back.

09:39.245 --> 09:42.180
But I still don't know how I can...

09:45.184 --> 09:48.620
I don't even know what I truly wish for.

09:50.323 --> 09:51.881
But there's no more time.

09:52.925 --> 09:55.052
Because he's calling me...

10:01.200 --> 10:02.258
Farewell...

10:03.736 --> 10:04.862
...Subaru.

10:36.302 --> 10:40.932
For you, the Dragons of Earth, the Dragons of Heaven...

10:41.007 --> 10:45.444
...and even the outcome of this Final Battle has no meaning.

10:46.946 --> 10:50.905
Because your one and only wish is already gone...

10:52.852 --> 10:55.753
I heard about you from Hokuto.

10:57.523 --> 11:01.186
I had seen her death in my dreams...

11:01.260 --> 11:03.023
...but I couldn't do anything.

11:04.096 --> 11:07.361
And at that time, my wish also disappeared.

11:08.768 --> 11:12.033
The person I had feelings for was gone.

11:12.104 --> 11:13.867
Just like you...

11:29.655 --> 11:32.647
To change destiny and save his soul...

11:32.725 --> 11:36.388
...you need to kill the Kamui of the Dragons of Heaven.

11:39.899 --> 11:41.298
Arashi!

11:41.367 --> 11:42.891
Don't be stupid...

11:44.470 --> 11:46.335
If you do anything to Kamui...

11:47.373 --> 11:48.965
...I will...

11:49.041 --> 11:50.008
...kill you.

12:27.379 --> 12:28.505
Fuma...

12:30.449 --> 12:32.280
I've been waiting for you...

12:32.351 --> 12:33.477
...Kamui.

12:34.987 --> 12:39.686
The Dragon of Heaven dreamseer entrusted her wish to you, right?

12:39.759 --> 12:43.058
Though she knew the future she saw in dreams wouldn't change.

12:44.964 --> 12:48.593
There's no way you'll ever awaken as the true Kamui...

12:48.667 --> 12:50.066
...of the Dragons of Heaven.

12:53.472 --> 12:56.066
You must be aware of that yourself.

13:05.518 --> 13:06.644
Kamui...

13:18.297 --> 13:20.265
I am not your opponent.

13:24.336 --> 13:25.303
Arashi?

13:30.309 --> 13:31.298
Arashi...

13:31.377 --> 13:32.366
Why are you...

13:34.246 --> 13:38.080
Because her wish is to defeat you.

13:38.150 --> 13:39.447
Stop it, Arashi!

13:43.422 --> 13:45.856
Try to grant that wish of yours.

13:50.329 --> 13:52.524
Arashi, stop this nonsense!

14:04.243 --> 14:05.972
Stop it, Arashi!

14:06.045 --> 14:07.171
Sorata...

14:08.647 --> 14:09.614
Stop it.

14:19.425 --> 14:21.325
I'm a Dragon of Heaven!

14:21.393 --> 14:24.453
It's my duty to protect Kamui as long as I'm alive!

14:29.568 --> 14:30.865
Sorata...

14:30.936 --> 14:32.062
Arashi...

15:39.872 --> 15:42.033
What a joke...

15:42.107 --> 15:44.701
You betrayed me as a Dragon of Earth.

15:47.546 --> 15:50.106
There is only one path left for you.

15:52.518 --> 15:54.918
To accept your own death.

15:57.122 --> 15:58.089
Right?

16:18.777 --> 16:20.472
S...

16:20.546 --> 16:21.774
Sorata...

16:26.652 --> 16:29.177
This is his destiny.

16:29.254 --> 16:31.552
Everything you did was futile.

16:31.623 --> 16:33.420
And you're next!

16:34.493 --> 16:36.552
I won't let you do that.

16:42.001 --> 16:42.968
Sorata!

17:10.496 --> 17:12.464
S-Sorata!

17:17.703 --> 17:18.897
Sorata!

17:24.343 --> 17:25.640
Sorata...

17:26.979 --> 17:30.005
Meet Kamui and be of his aid.

17:30.082 --> 17:31.640
Protect him with your life.

17:32.985 --> 17:36.751
But you will die for the sake of a woman.

17:40.392 --> 17:45.659
You will lose your life for the sake of the woman that you love.

17:55.441 --> 17:57.033
F-Father...

17:59.078 --> 18:00.045
Father...

18:04.817 --> 18:05.784
Sorata!

18:05.851 --> 18:07.614
Sorata, hold on!

18:07.686 --> 18:09.313
Hold on!

18:09.388 --> 18:11.447
I don't want you to die...

18:11.523 --> 18:12.547
Please don't die.

18:14.560 --> 18:16.255
M-Missie...

18:17.296 --> 18:19.025
You're not hurt, right?

18:19.098 --> 18:21.794
Sorata, why did you do this?

18:23.035 --> 18:25.333
This is how it should be...

18:25.404 --> 18:28.601
Kamui, forgive the missie here...

18:29.641 --> 18:32.075
She did it all for me...

18:33.112 --> 18:35.080
To protect me...

18:35.147 --> 18:36.375
I understand.

18:36.448 --> 18:37.938
Sorata, it's fine now.

18:40.919 --> 18:43.444
Gramps, I did it...

18:44.490 --> 18:45.718
Just like you said...

18:46.758 --> 18:48.692
I protected Kamui...

18:48.760 --> 18:50.489
...and for a woman's sake...

18:50.562 --> 18:51.859
No!

18:51.930 --> 18:54.330
I don't want you to die!

18:54.399 --> 18:56.492
Please don't cry...

18:56.568 --> 18:59.833
I don't want to see a woman cry...

19:00.672 --> 19:01.639
No...

19:04.443 --> 19:06.707
Promise me, missie...

19:08.013 --> 19:10.208
Live on for the two of us...

19:11.250 --> 19:15.050
That'll be the only proof that I existed...

19:15.921 --> 19:17.081
Sorata...

19:18.390 --> 19:21.450
Can you promise me, missie?

19:23.095 --> 19:24.084
That you'll live...

19:30.002 --> 19:32.129
You really are beautiful...

19:33.172 --> 19:35.163
I'm such a lucky guy...

19:36.208 --> 19:38.438
I'm really glad...

19:38.510 --> 19:41.638
...I was able to meet you, missie.

19:43.749 --> 19:45.774
Sorata...

19:45.851 --> 19:46.818
Sorata!

20:04.403 --> 20:05.870
Sorata...

20:07.940 --> 20:11.239
Gramps, you taught me how to use my powers.

20:12.277 --> 20:16.680
So that I can die protecting the woman I'll fall in love with.

20:16.748 --> 20:19.740
That's why I'm so grateful to you, Gramps.

20:20.819 --> 20:22.377
Sorata...

20:22.454 --> 20:23.648
So...

20:25.457 --> 20:26.947
Gramps, pray with me...

20:27.025 --> 20:29.687
...that the girl I fall for is a beautiful lady.

20:29.761 --> 20:32.389
Hey, where's Sorata?

20:32.464 --> 20:34.159
I'm still in my growth spurt.

20:34.233 --> 20:36.394
- I can't help it.
- Oh, it's Sorata!

20:36.468 --> 20:38.333
Hey, Sorata!

20:38.403 --> 20:40.064
Leave the pastries behind!

20:40.138 --> 20:41.435
Sorata!
